b2.push(a3.$2("Daily and Weekly","The Daily is the same run for everyone on the same day. It resets at local midnight, and a Daily still running then expires. It runs from four to nine letters; the optional Daily Stretch carries on from ten to twelve. The Weekly is the same run for everyone in the same week, from Monday 00:00 local; its Tempo changes every week. It opens once every setting is unlocked."))
