b2.push(a3.$2(a,"Configure your next run, and choose which moments play a sound or vibrate. The Seed is the code that rebuilds a run, with the same settings and the same words: copy it from a run\u2019s Run Summary or from Settings to share your run, paste a friend\u2019s to play theirs (unlocked once every Challenge and setting is), or make a new one."))
b2.push(a3.$2("Awards","Awards mark milestones across all your play, from your first word to mastering every Lexicon. Some are graded Bronze to Platinum, and some earn a Title."))
